{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>You shall not glean.</b> If you found in it gleaning-leavings — you shall not take them. And what are gleaning-leavings? Any cluster that has neither a shoulder nor a drip. If it has one of them — it belongs to the householder (Sifra); and I saw in the Jerusalem Talmud: What is a shoulder? Segments stacked one atop the other. A drip — those that hang from the spine and descend."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:48:15.879883744Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}